WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.610
An embryo in a laboratory dish.

2
00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:05.420
A gene edited to cure a disease.

3
00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:07.940
A heart valve taken from a pig.

4
00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:10.480
Modern medicine can do all three.

5
00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.230
But Muslims believe life
is God's gift and trust.

6
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:18.550
The Qur'an calls it the life
which Allah hath made sacred.

7
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.620
So if life belongs to God,
can Muslims still use IVF,

8
00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.420
gene therapy or pig heart valves?

9
00:00:25.470 --> 00:00:29.820
In this mission, you'll trace
the first 120 days of an embryo,

10
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.990
as a famous hadith describes them.

11
00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:36.270
Then you'll compare how the four main
schools of Sunni law answer the hardest

12
00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:37.350
cases.

13
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:42.390
Your mission: find out how Muslims decide
when medicine meets a life that belongs

14
00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:43.150
to God.
